              next pointer is a pointer to a _s_h_o_r_t _i_n_t (rather than _i_n_t).

     ll (ell)  Indicates that the conversion will be one of bbddiioouuxx or nn and the
              next pointer is a pointer to a _l_o_n_g _i_n_t (rather than _i_n_t), that
              the conversion will be one of aa, ee, ff, or gg and the next pointer
              is a pointer to _d_o_u_b_l_e (rather than _f_l_o_a_t), or that the conver‐
              sion will be one of cc, ss or [[ and the next pointer is a pointer
              to an array of _w_c_h_a_r___t (rather than _c_h_a_r).

     llll (ell ell)
              Indicates that the conversion will be one of bbddiioouuxx or nn and the
